---Specifies the configuration and other settings for an activity in a journey.
---@class aws.pinpoint.Activity
---@field CUSTOM? aws.pinpoint.CustomMessageActivity The settings for a custom message activity. This type of activity calls an AWS Lambda function or web hook that sends messages to participants.
---@field ConditionalSplit? aws.pinpoint.ConditionalSplitActivity The settings for a yes/no split activity. This type of activity sends participants down one of two paths in a journey, based on conditions that you specify.
---@field Description? aws.pinpoint.__string The custom description of the activity.
---@field EMAIL? aws.pinpoint.EmailMessageActivity The settings for an email activity. This type of activity sends an email message to participants.
---@field Holdout? aws.pinpoint.HoldoutActivity The settings for a holdout activity. This type of activity stops a journey for a specified percentage of participants.
---@field MultiCondition? aws.pinpoint.MultiConditionalSplitActivity The settings for a multivariate split activity. This type of activity sends participants down one of as many as five paths (including a default Else path) in a journey, based on conditions that you specify.
---@field PUSH? aws.pinpoint.PushMessageActivity The settings for a push notification activity. This type of activity sends a push notification to participants.
---@field RandomSplit? aws.pinpoint.RandomSplitActivity The settings for a random split activity. This type of activity randomly sends specified percentages of participants down one of as many as five paths in a journey, based on conditions that you specify.
---@field SMS? aws.pinpoint.SMSMessageActivity The settings for an SMS activity. This type of activity sends a text message to participants.
---@field Wait? aws.pinpoint.WaitActivity The settings for a wait activity. This type of activity waits for a certain amount of time or until a specific date and time before moving participants to the next activity in a journey.
---@field ContactCenter? aws.pinpoint.ContactCenterActivity The settings for a connect activity. This type of activity initiates a contact center call to participants.

