---Specifies the settings for a job that exports endpoint definitions to an Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) bucket.
---@class aws.pinpoint.ExportJobRequest
---@field RoleArn aws.pinpoint.__string The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) role that authorizes Amazon Pinpoint to access the Amazon S3 location where you want to export endpoint definitions to.
---@field S3UrlPrefix aws.pinpoint.__string The URL of the location in an Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) bucket where you want to export endpoint definitions to. This location is typically a folder that contains multiple files. The URL should be in the following format: s3://bucket-name/folder-name/.
---@field SegmentId? aws.pinpoint.__string The identifier for the segment to export endpoint definitions from. If you don't specify this value, Amazon Pinpoint exports definitions for all the endpoints that are associated with the application.
---@field SegmentVersion? aws.pinpoint.__integer The version of the segment to export endpoint definitions from, if specified.

---Provides information about the resource settings for a job that exports endpoint definitions to a file. The file can be added directly to an Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) bucket by using the Amazon Pinpoint API or downloaded directly to a computer by using the Amazon Pinpoint console.
---@class aws.pinpoint.ExportJobResource
---@field RoleArn aws.pinpoint.__string The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) role that authorized Amazon Pinpoint to access the Amazon S3 location where the endpoint definitions were exported to.
---@field S3UrlPrefix aws.pinpoint.__string The URL of the location in an Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) bucket where the endpoint definitions were exported to. This location is typically a folder that contains multiple files. The URL should be in the following format: s3://bucket-name/folder-name/.
---@field SegmentId? aws.pinpoint.__string The identifier for the segment that the endpoint definitions were exported from. If this value isn't present, Amazon Pinpoint exported definitions for all the endpoints that are associated with the application.
---@field SegmentVersion? aws.pinpoint.__integer The version of the segment that the endpoint definitions were exported from.

---Provides information about the status and settings of a job that exports endpoint definitions to a file. The file can be added directly to an Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) bucket by using the Amazon Pinpoint API or downloaded directly to a computer by using the Amazon Pinpoint console.
---@class aws.pinpoint.ExportJobResponse
---@field ApplicationId aws.pinpoint.__string The unique identifier for the application that's associated with the export job.
---@field CompletedPieces? aws.pinpoint.__integer The number of pieces that were processed successfully (completed) by the export job, as of the time of the request.
---@field CompletionDate? aws.pinpoint.__string The date, in ISO 8601 format, when the export job was completed.
---@field CreationDate aws.pinpoint.__string The date, in ISO 8601 format, when the export job was created.
---@field Definition aws.pinpoint.ExportJobResource The resource settings that apply to the export job.
---@field FailedPieces? aws.pinpoint.__integer The number of pieces that weren't processed successfully (failed) by the export job, as of the time of the request.
---@field Failures? aws.pinpoint.ListOf__string An array of entries, one for each of the first 100 entries that weren't processed successfully (failed) by the export job, if any.
---@field Id aws.pinpoint.__string The unique identifier for the export job.
---@field JobStatus aws.pinpoint.JobStatus The status of the export job. The job status is FAILED if Amazon Pinpoint wasn't able to process one or more pieces in the job.
---@field TotalFailures? aws.pinpoint.__integer The total number of endpoint definitions that weren't processed successfully (failed) by the export job, typically because an error, such as a syntax error, occurred.
---@field TotalPieces? aws.pinpoint.__integer The total number of pieces that must be processed to complete the export job. Each piece consists of an approximately equal portion of the endpoint definitions that are part of the export job.
---@field TotalProcessed? aws.pinpoint.__integer The total number of endpoint definitions that were processed by the export job.
---@field Type aws.pinpoint.__string The job type. This value is EXPORT for export jobs.

---Provides information about all the export jobs that are associated with an application or segment. An export job is a job that exports endpoint definitions to a file.
